<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila o/night money holds but rates seen falling.</title>
<headline>Manila o/night money holds but rates seen falling.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>------------------------ May 7 -------------------------</p>
<p>* Volume higher at 19.29 bln from 18.27 bln pesos</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Manila overnight money was steady at an average of 11.5625 percent on Wednesday as the Central Bank maintained its overnight borrowing rate at 11.5 percent, traders said.</p>
<p>They, however, saw a decline in interest rates following the inflows of foreign money for fixed income securities.</p>
<p>Done rates were in a band of 11.75 to 11.53125 percent, with 33 lenders and 20 borrowers.</p>
</text>
